/* Focused regression harness for the rsyslog cstring deserialization fix.
 *
 * Drives the REAL static objDeserializeStr() from runtime/obj.c and the REAL
 * cstrConstruct()/rsCStrDestruct() from runtime/stringbuf.c.  obj.c is textually
 * included so the static function and the static strm interface are visible; a
 * fake strm.ReadChar feeds crafted bytes.
 *
